### 0. 健康检查（服务是否存活）
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 1. 创建渠道
POST http://localhost:8080/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DeepSeek 主",
  "provider": "deepseek",
  "base_url": "http://localhost:9090/v1",
  "api_key": "sk-test-123",
  "weight": 1,
  "models": "deepseek-v1-flash",
  "enabled": true
}

### 2. 渠道列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/channels

### 3. 创建第二个渠道（测多条 + 中文）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "OpenAI 备用",
  "provider": "openai",
  "base_url": "https://api.openai.com/v1",
  "api_key": "sk-test-456",
  "weight": 2
}

### 4. 渠道详情（把 3 换成真实 id）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/channels/3

### 5. 更新渠道（把 3 换成真实 id；测 0/false 也能更新成功）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/channels/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DeepSeek 主-改",
  "provider": "deepseek",
  "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
  "api_key": "sk-new-key-999",
  "weight": 0,
  "enabled": false
}

### 6. 删除渠道（把 3 换成真实 id）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/channels/5

### 7. 删除不存在的渠道（应返回 404）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/channels/999

### 8. AI 网关统一入口（第 4 步：转发到渠道上游）
# 前置：渠道的 base_url 指向 mock 上游（http://localhost:9090/v1）
# 先开 mock：go run ./cmd/mockupstream，再调下面接口
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "mock-upstream",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "你好，网关在吗？"}
  ]
}

### 9. 网关 SSE 流式（打字机效果）
# 前置：mock 上游正在运行（go run ./cmd/mockupstream）
# 用 curl -N（不缓冲）才能看到逐块输出；REST Client 会等流结束再显示
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "mock-upstream",
  "stream": true,
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "来一段流式回复"}
  ]
}



### [W2-②-1] 创建 Anthropic 渠道（渠道 13 已建好，可跳过；重跑会新建 14）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Claude Conv Test",
  "provider": "anthropic",
  "base_url": "http://localhost:9090/v1",
  "api_key": "sk-claude-test-001",
  "weight": 1000000,
  "enabled": true,
  "models": "claude-3-5-sonnet"
}

### [W2-②-2] 流式转换验证：model=claude-3-5-sonnet（stream=true）
# 预期：OpenAI 格式 SSE —— data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"..."}}]}
#      末尾 data: {"choices":[{"delta":{},"finish_reason":"stop","index":0}]}
#      再补一个 data: [DONE]（修复 A：Anthropic 无 [DONE]，网关补发）
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "你好"}],
  "stream": true
}

### [W2-②-3] 非流式转换验证：stream=false（修复 B）
# 预期：OpenAI 格式 {"choices":[{"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"...（Anthropic 格式）"},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{...}}
# 内容带"（Anthropic 格式）"后缀 = 命中的是 Anthropic 渠道且转换成功
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "你好"}],
  "stream": false
}

### [W2-②-4] 路由隔离：model 不匹配 claude 渠道
# 预期：渠道 13（models=claude-3-5-sonnet）不被命中
# 看 server 终端日志 "[relay] 尝试渠道 id=X" 确认命中了谁；响应仍是合法 OpenAI 格式
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "hi"}],
  "stream": true
}




# 故障测试（熔断与健康探测验证）
### [CB-0] 前置确认：服务正常
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{"model": "mock-upstream", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "hi"}], "stream": false}




### [CB-1] 开启 mock 故障模式（所有接口返回 503）
POST http://localhost:9090/debug/fail
Content-Type: application/json

{"on": true}

### [CB-2] 连发 10 次请求（让渠道连续失败触发熔断；失败的 502/503 是预期）
# 预期：前几次 502（网关尝试多个渠道都失败），
#       中途某个渠道连续失败 3 次被熔断摘除（日志里不再尝试它），
#       最后全部熔断 → 响应"所有渠道均不可用"
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{"model": "mock-upstream", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "hi"}], "stream": false}




### [CB-3] 关闭 mock 故障模式
POST http://localhost:9090/debug/fail
Content-Type: application/json

{"on": false}

### [CB-4] 等 15~30 秒（健康探测周期 15s）后，恢复正常
# 预期：server 日志出现 "[probe] 渠道 id=X 探活成功 → 恢复调度"，
#       本请求恢复 200 正常返回
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{"model": "mock-upstream", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "hi"}], "stream": false}








